{"id":"7970350a3b94dd0b","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-theory.md","title":"Sentence Axiom Sets","display":"df-theory — Sentence Axiom Sets","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-theory","aliases":["90-df-theory"],"display":"df-theory — Sentence Axiom Sets","depends_on":["[[90-df-base-free-variable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-theory"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-theory</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-theory — Sentence Axiom Sets"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b24fa26209f44674\" href=\"?note=b24fa26209f44674\" title=\"90-df-base-free-variable\">90-df-base-free-variable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Lang}(\\Lambda)\">\\(\\operatorname{Lang}(\\Lambda)\\)</span>；公式与自由变量来自本地底层语法。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,\\Delta\">\\(T,\\Delta\\)</span> 为公式集的候选子集。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>本书调用的 theory 参数是句子公理集，不要求演绎闭包，也不把呈示三元组默认为集合。三元证明呈示及其 Ax 视图仍由原谓词逻辑文件给出。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>包含关系式中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Lambda&#39;\">\\(\\Lambda&#39;\\)</span> 为与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Lambda\">\\(\\Lambda\\)</span> 使用同一变量表的分层签名。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Sent}^{88}_\\Lambda&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{88}_\\Lambda:\\operatorname{free}^{88}_\\Lambda(\\varphi)=\\varnothing\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Theory}_\\Lambda(T)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}^{88}_\\Lambda,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Theory}_\\Lambda(T)\\land\\operatorname{Theory}_\\Lambda(\\Delta)&amp;\\Longrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Theory}_\\Lambda(T\\cup\\Delta),\\\\\n\\Lambda\\subseteq\\Lambda&#39;\\land\\operatorname{Theory}_\\Lambda(T)&amp;\\Longrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Theory}_{\\Lambda&#39;}(T).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Sent}^{88}_\\Lambda&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{88}_\\Lambda:\\operatorname{free}^{88}_\\Lambda(\\varphi)=\\varnothing\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Theory}_\\Lambda(T)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}^{88}_\\Lambda,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Theory}_\\Lambda(T)\\land\\operatorname{Theory}_\\Lambda(\\Delta)&amp;\\Longrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Theory}_\\Lambda(T\\cup\\Delta),\\\\\n\\Lambda\\subseteq\\Lambda&#39;\\land\\operatorname{Theory}_\\Lambda(T)&amp;\\Longrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Theory}_{\\Lambda&#39;}(T).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本文件依据第 90 本实际调用的接口补齐未提供的外部依赖，供本书内部使用；不声称复原未提供的外部原文。 可计算性、一致性和算术强度均不是 Theory 的隐含条件；需要时由后续原谓词分别施加。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-base-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"b24fa26209f44674","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-base-free-variable]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Lang}(\\Lambda)","display":false},{"tex":"T,\\Delta","display":false},{"tex":"\\Lambda'","display":false},{"tex":"\\Lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Sent}^{88}_\\Lambda&\\coloneqq\n\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{88}_\\Lambda:\\operatorname{free}^{88}_\\Lambda(\\varphi)=\\varnothing\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Theory}_\\Lambda(T)&\\Longleftrightarrow T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}^{88}_\\Lambda,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Theory}_\\Lambda(T)\\land\\operatorname{Theory}_\\Lambda(\\Delta)&\\Longrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Theory}_\\Lambda(T\\cup\\Delta),\\\\\n\\Lambda\\subseteq\\Lambda'\\land\\operatorname{Theory}_\\Lambda(T)&\\Longrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Theory}_{\\Lambda'}(T).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1493,"backlinks":[{"id":"b7d96c072a4c677f","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T,\\Delta\\subseteq\\{\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_L:\\operatorname{FV}(\\sigma)=\\varnothing\\}$；这实例化 [[90-df-theory]] 的句子公理集接口。下式局部推导将 [[90-df-provable]] 的参数固定为 $(F,A,\\mathcal R)=(\\mathrm{Fml}_L,\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{FOL}},\\mathrm{Rules}_{\\mathrm{FOL}})$；后两个集合在 Assertion 中定义。"},{"id":"10ddd9c20c6edffd","anchor":"ref-31","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-theory]]"},{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-182","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-acceptable-program-numbering.md]]\n[[90-df-atomic-formula.md]]\n[[90-df-base-formula.md]]\n[[90-df-base-free-variable.md]]\n[[90-df-base-godel-numbering.md]]\n[[90-df-ce-indexing.md]]\n[[90-df-ce-set.md]]\n[[90-df-computable-function.md]]\n[[90-df-encoding.md]]\n[[90-df-hilbert-bernays.md]]\n[[90-df-iota-operator.md]]\n[[90-df-language.md]]\n[[90-df-many-one-reducible.md]]\n[[90-df-omega.md]]\n[[90-df-provable.md]]\n[[90-df-relation.md]]\n[[90-df-satisfaction.md]]\n[[90-df-structure.md]]\n[[90-df-substitution.md]]\n[[90-df-term.md]]\n[[90-df-theory.md]]\n[[90-df-tm-halts.md]]\n[[90-df-tm-output.md]]\n[[90-df-turing-machine.md]]\n[[90-df-variable.md]]\n[[90-thm-smn.md]]"}],"outgoing":["b24fa26209f44674"]}